<title>USA: Johnson &amp; Johnson unit product gets FDA OK.</title>
<headline>Johnson &amp; Johnson unit product gets FDA OK.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WASHINGTON, Pa. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>McNeil Consumer Products Co said Friday the U.S. Food and Drug Administration has approved the company's petition to market Imodium Advanced for the treatment of diarrhea and gas symptoms.</p>
<p>The Johnson &amp; Johnson unit said the product will be available over the counter in chewable tablet form later this year.</p>
</text>
